  "footnote": "No prerequisites for entry. Major courses require a minimum grade of C. At most three courses from another literature major may also count toward this major; the app cannot check overlap. Study-abroad course counts require faculty-advisor consultation and Director of Undergraduate Studies approval. FWS courses cannot count toward the major; ENGL 2860 or ENGL 2880 used to satisfy FWS also cannot count. Optional honors requires 36 credits and a roughly 50-page senior essay (COML 4930 and COML 4940), supervised by a faculty member, preferably in the department. COML 4930 or COML 4940 may count as one required COML course. Honors eligibility requires at least B+ on the senior essay, in major coursework, and overall at Cornell, starting with 2026-27 graduates. The page does not resolve how the general half-in-original-language rule is measured for the media track; confirm with the advisor.",
